WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Inside the Ragnarok, an alien Propagator creature lurks amid the machinery.

2
00:04.500 --> 00:08.500
Squall strides through a blindingly bright corridor toward the cockpit.

3
00:09.000 --> 00:13.000
Close-up of Squall in the control room, scar on his face.

4
00:13.500 --> 00:18.000
Rinoa and Squall face each other, reaching out in the cockpit.

5
00:18.500 --> 00:25.000
They embrace tightly. Squall closes his eyes, holding her against him.
